<para><computeroutput>unsigned int aiAnimMesh::mNumVertices</computeroutput></para>
<para>The number of vertices in the <link linkend="_structai_anim_mesh">aiAnimMesh</link>, and thus the length of all the member arrays.</para>

<para>This has always the same value as the mNumVertices property in the corresponding <link linkend="_structai_mesh">aiMesh</link>. It is duplicated here merely to make the length of the member arrays accessible even if the <link linkend="_structai_mesh">aiMesh</link> is not known, e.g. from language bindings. </para>
